Acknowledgement

SkillWarden was written after studying SkillSpector, NVIDIA's open-source security
scanner for AI agent skills (https://github.com/NVIDIA/SkillSpector, Apache-2.0).
It follows the same staged approach (static analysis, then an optional semantic
pass), the same threat categories, SARIF output and baseline suppression. The code
is our own.
